      "widgets_values": [
        "# Upgrade: preserve the genuine source — EXPERIMENT\n\nThis is a separate usable native editing option, NOT High beauty or a replacement for the production workflow.\nThis case preserves the successful val03 recipe: only output prefix and same-file input-name spelling change.\nRun only on the exact isolated worker admitted by the owner after BOTH GPUs, queues, models and output are checked.\nRoot may explicitly admit the separate native RTX4070 experiment; the public Upgrade RTX3090 lock is unchanged.\nThis ordinary-node graph has no device-enforcement node: do not queue it on an arbitrary worker.\n\nSOURCE -> whole-frame bicubic 1MP -> full VAE -> reference on BOTH CFG branches.\nOne source only; no competing front portrait, Canny guide or isolated hair donor.\nExisting genuine-trained Mitch LoRA .9 remains; Phone v13 .25, its casual snapshot trigger, 50 Euler / CFG4,\nseed8675412, 816x1088, base FP8 load, empty target latent, full VAE. No Turbo, mask, face warp, polish,\nrestoration, upscaler or second pass. Output is a complete generative re-render, not copied source pixels.\n\nThe input already must depict the right person. Do not use this case to fix an incorrect synthetic face.\nThe text is source-specific: do not change the photo without also reviewing text and BOTH output dimensions.\nOther photos are unvalidated. The house/canyon source-only failures remain failures; there is no universal route.\nGenerated detail is plausible, not recovered truth. Skin, pupil focus, expression and background still need review.\nPreserve the original source; exclude val03 from identity scores. Existing stronger High remains separate and unfinished.\n"
      ]
